      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Assessing the true level of instability requires real-time local intelligence beyond daily news cycles. While protests signal political tension, the current government's capacity to maintain order in major tourist hubs is often a key factor travelers observe. If you are concerned about safety in specific cities, I suggest focusing your search on recent, specific reports regarding security in those exact areas rather than broad national updates. This will give you a more relevant picture of day-to-day traveler safety.",
